6	 * Immutable, structured audit event for a newly created owner, emitted (as JSON) to the
7	 * {@code AUDIT} logger alongside the human-readable audit line.
8	 *
9	 * <p>The event carries the owner id and the owner's <em>current primary identifier</em>. Today
10	 * that identifier is the {@code customerCode}; when a later checkpoint unifies the customerCode
11	 * into a {@code memberId}, the caller passes the memberId here instead and the event carries it —
12	 * the shape of the event does not change, only the value fed into {@code customerCode}.
13	 *
